# LongCat's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-longcat-setting-cookie = LongCat 控制台会话。登录 https://longcat.chat/platform/usage，打开开发者工具 > Application > Cookies > https://longcat.chat，复制该网站的所有 Cookie（控制台未说明哪个 Cookie 保存会话）。以 "name=value; name2=value2" 的形式粘贴，或在 Network 标签页中复制发往 longcat.chat 的请求的 Cookie 请求标头。

## The report: the token quota and the fuel packs on top of it. Token
## counts (such as 1212576/50000000) stay as figures.

usage-longcat-token-quota = Token 配额
usage-longcat-tokens-used = 已用 Token
# A window: the fuel packs' tokens used, until the nearest one expires.
usage-longcat-fuel-pack = 加油包
usage-longcat-fuel-pack-left = 加油包剩余额度
# A section's title: the token quota and fuel pack figures.
usage-longcat-quota = 配额
